    "text": "By WSBT 22 ,\n4 hours ago SOUTH BEND, Ind. (WSBT) — A 16-year-old is dead after a shooting in South Bend Wednesday afternoon. South Bend Police responded to the 1300 block of Dubail Street around 5 p.m. for a report of shots fired. Upon arrival they found the victim suffering from an apparent gunshot wound. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
